 "text": "Hey, good to have you with me. So, how are you? Nice. Set it up in advance, and it be smooth. Pitch a tent, not an idea, it goes pop when you lay down. Sure. Hey there! It's your friend. Then they haven't arrived yet. They take up space anyway, a good tent beats one. Sure thing. No worries. We were just checking if you still wanted to chat. Your friend still waiting for solar panels, or has he gone? Sounds lovely. The reservoir will be up full from last night, and there's never one waiting on us.",
